# Local runtime state at the repository root only. These were unanchored, and
# `jobs/` silently swallowed apps/control-plane/api/video-studio/jobs/[id]/,
# so two live routes were never committed and CI caught it on a clean checkout.
# Anchor them: they mean the runtime directories here, not any path segment.
